## Notes

The DHCP pools specify gateways at `192.168.10.1` and `192.168.64.1`. These gateway addresses must be configured on the router or appropriate Layer 3 devices serving the branch networks. The existing `FastEthernet0/0` and `FastEthernet0/1` interfaces use `10.0.0.1` and `10.0.0.5`, respectively, so additional LAN-facing interfaces or devices may be required for the DHCP setup to work as intended.
